(2919697, 406241, 44490, '<td valign="top">"Knot" really a woody.  The line of the tree is distracting, if you shifted just a bit to the left you''d be able to make it less central.  Nice shallow DOF separation.</td>', '"Knot" really a woody.  The line of the tree is distracting, if you shifted just a bit to the left you''d be able to make it less central.  Nice shallow DOF separation.', '2006-10-11 18:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919698, 409237, 44490, '<td valign="top">Ha, ha!  This is really trying, complete with visible tag.  Pretty good portrait of the wrong woody.  Sorry.  But you made me laugh...</td>', 'Ha, ha!  This is really trying, complete with visible tag.  Pretty good portrait of the wrong woody.  Sorry.  But you made me laugh...', '2006-10-11 18:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919700, 408126, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose conveying sadness.  The image appears too dark, even intentionally low-key images should have some highlights on the subject, so brighter would be better.</td>', 'Nice pose conveying sadness.  The image appears too dark, even intentionally low-key images should have some highlights on the subject, so brighter would be better.', '2006-10-11 18:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919701, 409454, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice flowers and contrast to background, but where''s woody?  Also, please make your images larger, see the tutorial on preparing photos for DPC challenges.</td>', 'Nice flowers and contrast to background, but where''s woody?  Also, please make your images larger, see the tutorial on preparing photos for DPC challenges.', '2006-10-11 18:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919702, 409797, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and effect, wish for woody/subject to be a bit brighter and sharper.  It almost looks like a heart on woody''s chest, something just a bit brigher and more recognizable would provide a needed focal point / point of interest.</td>', 'Interesting concept and effect, wish for woody/subject to be a bit brighter and sharper.  It almost looks like a heart on woody''s chest, something just a bit brigher and more recognizable would provide a needed focal point / point of interest.', '2006-10-11 18:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919703, 409254, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea and pretty good posing of figures.  Looks like back focus on the lion.  Focus on woody''s shoes would help with DOF to include all of woody.<br/>More visible shoes and better lighting for shoes would help.</td>', 'Great idea and pretty good posing of figures.  Looks like back focus on the lion.  Focus on woody''s shoes would help with DOF to include all of woody.More visible shoes and better lighting for shoes would help.', '2006-10-11 18:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919704, 407490, 44490, '<td valign="top">Woodys'' appear well read and ready to testify.  Better focus, sharpness, and more DOF for woody would help.  A simpler arrangement would probably be more effective.  Higher ISO or a tripod would help get you more DOF.</td>', 'Woodys'' appear well read and ready to testify.  Better focus, sharpness, and more DOF for woody would help.  A simpler arrangement would probably be more effective.  Higher ISO or a tripod would help get you more DOF.', '2006-10-11 18:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919713, 409772, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  More lighting on woodies would help, and simpler/less-busy would probably be better.</td>', 'Nice idea.  More lighting on woodies would help, and simpler/less-busy would probably be better.', '2006-10-11 18:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919739, 408622, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, colors, composition.  More prominent woody would probably be better.  Consider placing woody on top of the stancion, shot with a longer focal length to feature woody in the foreground, with the ship isolated in the background.  Probably a case where less is more.</td>', 'Nice idea, colors, composition.  More prominent woody would probably be better.  Consider placing woody on top of the stancion, shot with a longer focal length to feature woody in the foreground, with the ship isolated in the background.  Probably a case where less is more.', '2006-10-11 18:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919743, 408833, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement and composition.  While lighting is dramatic and focussed on woody, more fill on the duckies would help, especially to match your title, as the small duck is just too obscure and unrecognizable.</td>', 'Nice arrangement and composition.  While lighting is dramatic and focussed on woody, more fill on the duckies would help, especially to match your title, as the small duck is just too obscure and unrecognizable.', '2006-10-11 18:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919749, 409836, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The chosen composition puts a strong line right down the middle, consider recomposing.  Better focus and more DOF would help.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The chosen composition puts a strong line right down the middle, consider recomposing.  Better focus and more DOF would help.', '2006-10-11 18:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919750, 407522, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, arrangement, composition.  Wish for more visibility/lighting, especially on the small new one to fit the title.</td>', 'Nice idea, arrangement, composition.  Wish for more visibility/lighting, especially on the small new one to fit the title.', '2006-10-11 18:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919751, 409796, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Tighter crop, more DOF, and more saturation would be better.  From this perspective, woody''s head is too dead on from the top, some angle would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Tighter crop, more DOF, and more saturation would be better.  From this perspective, woody''s head is too dead on from the top, some angle would be better.', '2006-10-11 18:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919752, 407406, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Unfortunately, woody looses attention to the illuminated detail on the top of the image.  Some light, strobe or even flashlight, would help woody.</td>', 'Good idea.  Unfortunately, woody looses attention to the illuminated detail on the top of the image.  Some light, strobe or even flashlight, would help woody.', '2006-10-11 18:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919758, 408254, 44490, '<td valign="top">Seems like a nice image and good composition, but the image is too small.  Please see the tutorial on preparing photos for DPC challenges.</td>', 'Seems like a nice image and good composition, but the image is too small.  Please see the tutorial on preparing photos for DPC challenges.', '2006-10-11 18:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919770, 409562, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Unfortunately, the afro is mostly lost against the background.  Given that the afro is black, a lighter background would give better contrast.  Also, an additional afro tie-in would help, maybe something ''60-ish.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Unfortunately, the afro is mostly lost against the background.  Given that the afro is black, a lighter background would give better contrast.  Also, an additional afro tie-in would help, maybe something ''60-ish.', '2006-10-11 18:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919772, 407472, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nicely posed balancing act, a challenge in itself!  I think that a more complete shadow would be more interesting, or else less shadow, I''m sure you''ll get a range of suggestions.</td>', 'Nicely posed balancing act, a challenge in itself!  I think that a more complete shadow would be more interesting, or else less shadow, I''m sure you''ll get a range of suggestions.', '2006-10-11 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919773, 407528, 44490, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, nice pose and composition.  Plain contrasting background would help, thumb turned out without visible thumbnail would be less distracting.  Nice warm feel.</td>', 'Cute idea, nice pose and composition.  Plain contrasting background would help, thumb turned out without visible thumbnail would be less distracting.  Nice warm feel.', '2006-10-11 18:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919774, 409661, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and pose.  Focus appears to be on left arm, more DOF a slightly softer lighting would probably help.</td>', 'Nice idea and pose.  Focus appears to be on left arm, more DOF a slightly softer lighting would probably help.', '2006-10-11 18:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919775, 409814, 44490, '<td valign="top">Pretty good arrangement, interesting lighting.  Seems a little busy, simpler would be better, with DOF to include the ducky?</td>', 'Pretty good arrangement, interesting lighting.  Seems a little busy, simpler would be better, with DOF to include the ducky?', '2006-10-11 18:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919777, 409703, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice arrangement and composition, pretty good execution.  Shallower DOF would help smooth the background and make it less distracting - here''s where fast lenses show their worth.  Also, lighting from front would probably be better as the backlighting isn''t being used for much effect, IMHO.</td>', 'Great idea, nice arrangement and composition, pretty good execution.  Shallower DOF would help smooth the background and make it less distracting - here''s where fast lenses show their worth.  Also, lighting from front would probably be better as the backlighting isn''t being used for much effect, IMHO.', '2006-10-11 18:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919778, 408865, 44490, '<td valign="top">Maybe more like, "Alas poor Yorrick, I knew thee well?"  Trying to tie in the cork...  Nice pose, interesting lighting.</td>', 'Maybe more like, "Alas poor Yorrick, I knew thee well?"  Trying to tie in the cork...  Nice pose, interesting lighting.', '2006-10-11 18:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919779, 409775, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose.  A little more light might help, as I''m trying to make out more detail in the stick.</td>', 'Nice pose.  A little more light might help, as I''m trying to make out more detail in the stick.', '2006-10-11 18:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919780, 409833, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea and pretty good execution.  Remember, it''s advanced editing!  Cloning out the metal rod would be better.</td>', 'Great idea and pretty good execution.  Remember, it''s advanced editing!  Cloning out the metal rod would be better.', '2006-10-11 18:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919791, 409282, 44490, '<td valign="top">Ha, ha, ha!  Fun, and it made me smile.</td>', 'Ha, ha, ha!  Fun, and it made me smile.', '2006-10-11 18:45:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2919793, 409020, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, arrangement, and execution.  Softer and second/more light on right would help.</td>', 'Good idea, arrangement, and execution.  Softer and second/more light on right would help.', '2006-10-11 18:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919809, 409592, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The cardboard ruins the illusion with too obvious scale clues.  Brown construction paper would preserve the scale illusion.  The wall is a little too bright, move woody away from wall toward camera to adjust.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The cardboard ruins the illusion with too obvious scale clues.  Brown construction paper would preserve the scale illusion.  The wall is a little too bright, move woody away from wall toward camera to adjust.', '2006-10-11 18:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919810, 409477, 44490, '<td valign="top">What a great woody, with a face, hands, and figure!  Nice portrait, too.</td>', 'What a great woody, with a face, hands, and figure!  Nice portrait, too.', '2006-10-11 18:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919811, 409570, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and capture of the feeling with depth.  Focus appears to be on right, would be better on woody, and consider cropping out some of the right side.</td>', 'Nice idea and capture of the feeling with depth.  Focus appears to be on right, would be better on woody, and consider cropping out some of the right side.', '2006-10-11 18:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919815, 409482, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Just wish that you could add some depth to get away from being so linear/flat.  How about an arrangement and perspective coming towards the camera?</td>', 'Great idea.  Just wish that you could add some depth to get away from being so linear/flat.  How about an arrangement and perspective coming towards the camera?', '2006-10-11 18:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919838, 406244, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, composition, color gradients.  A little softer lighting might be better.</td>', 'Nice pose, composition, color gradients.  A little softer lighting might be better.', '2006-10-11 18:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919851, 409330, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between woody and the colorful butterfly.  Wish for more focus/DOF to include butterfly.</td>', 'Nice contrast between woody and the colorful butterfly.  Wish for more focus/DOF to include butterfly.', '2006-10-11 18:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919852, 409515, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, use, and posing of monkies and woodies.  Effective lighting.</td>', 'Good idea, use, and posing of monkies and woodies.  Effective lighting.', '2006-10-11 18:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919854, 409827, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and image, good composition, nice curve made by the film.  I''m not certain about the DOF choice, I think that the woody begs for attention versus the film frame, so I''m looking for sharpness/DOF to include woody.</td>', 'Interesting idea and image, good composition, nice curve made by the film.  I''m not certain about the DOF choice, I think that the woody begs for attention versus the film frame, so I''m looking for sharpness/DOF to include woody.', '2006-10-11 18:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919882, 408462, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement, colors, composition.  Just wonder if slightly brighter would be better, as it feels a bit darker than necessary?</td>', 'Nice arrangement, colors, composition.  Just wonder if slightly brighter would be better, as it feels a bit darker than necessary?', '2006-10-11 19:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919887, 407271, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, arrangement, composition, DOF.  I''d like a different perspective though, not so straight down from above, something more from the side that would show more of woody.</td>', 'Nice idea, arrangement, composition, DOF.  I''d like a different perspective though, not so straight down from above, something more from the side that would show more of woody.', '2006-10-11 19:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919890, 409283, 46294, '<td valign="top">Where?</td>', 'Where?', '2006-10-11 19:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919892, 408254, 46294, '<td valign="top">Why so small</td>', 'Why so small', '2006-10-11 19:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919906, 406761, 44490, '<td valign="top">Effective silhouette, nice arrangement, composition/framing, color.  I like the contrasting curves and shapes.</td>', 'Effective silhouette, nice arrangement, composition/framing, color.  I like the contrasting curves and shapes.', '2006-10-11 19:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919907, 409266, 44490, '<td valign="top">Simple, strong, effective.  Good focus and DOF.  I like it.</td>', 'Simple, strong, effective.  Good focus and DOF.  I like it.', '2006-10-11 19:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2919908, 406444, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting backlighting, illuminated hand, nice composition, striking.</td>', 'Interesting backlighting, illuminated hand, nice composition, striking.', '2006-10-11 19:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
