(2920637, 409397, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  I thought of doing something like this too.  Nice job, except I''m not too fond of the border, but that''s just me.</td>', 'Heh!  I thought of doing something like this too.  Nice job, except I''m not too fond of the border, but that''s just me.', '2006-10-11 22:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
