(2920673, 409515, 65025, '<td valign="top">Funny!  The one thing I would change is the bright highlights are a little too bright for me.  A little overblown.</td>', 'Funny!  The one thing I would change is the bright highlights are a little too bright for me.  A little overblown.', '2006-10-11 23:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
