(2922238, 409095, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute, clever, and well put together.  The shadows on the background lend even more credibility to your composition.  I''m thinking you positioned the woody figures in front of a print, cloned out any supporting wires/lines, etc...?  Regardless, it''s a fun photo to look at.  Congrats on a job well done!</td>', 'Cute, clever, and well put together.  The shadows on the background lend even more credibility to your composition.  I''m thinking you positioned the woody figures in front of a print, cloned out any supporting wires/lines, etc...?  Regardless, it''s a fun photo to look at.  Congrats on a job well done!', '2006-10-12 12:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
