(2922244, 409397, 30049, '<td valign="top">This gave me a chuckle as soon as I saw it.  :-)  Good thing Woody doesn''t really know Mom''s demise!  I can imagine some of the comments you''re getting..."Frame doesn''t work for me", "Subject too centered, should have cropped out the right", "Sky is blown out".  Hopefully others will have enjoyed it as I have.  One of my top picks.  Good luck!</td>', 'This gave me a chuckle as soon as I saw it.  :-)  Good thing Woody doesn''t really know Mom''s demise!  I can imagine some of the comments you''re getting..."Frame doesn''t work for me", "Subject too centered, should have cropped out the right", "Sky is blown out".  Hopefully others will have enjoyed it as I have.  One of my top picks.  Good luck!', '2006-10-12 12:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
