(2922252, 409844, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet effective.  The title fits well and even helps put an "emotive" expression on Woody''s "face".  The positioning of the subject and props work well in this photo (not too centered, nothing distracting, etc...).  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple, yet effective.  The title fits well and even helps put an "emotive" expression on Woody''s "face".  The positioning of the subject and props work well in this photo (not too centered, nothing distracting, etc...).  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-12 12:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922257, 408773, 66985, '<td valign="top">I find the print on the chair back and the frame on the wall detracts from the impact of the shot, without them this is a very good picture - although there''s obviously no Woody in it...</td>', 'I find the print on the chair back and the frame on the wall detracts from the impact of the shot, without them this is a very good picture - although there''s obviously no Woody in it...', '2006-10-12 12:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
