(2922734, 409755, 30049, '<td valign="top">Too funny.  Took some work also I''d imagine to put that "face" together.  Looks good overall, not seeing much I''d want to "fix".  ;^)  You''d probably sell a few of this as a stock photo.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Too funny.  Took some work also I''d imagine to put that "face" together.  Looks good overall, not seeing much I''d want to "fix".  ;^)  You''d probably sell a few of this as a stock photo.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-12 15:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922770, 409826, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is unique and creative.  I think the lighting in two places is going to pull this down some.  The light is a little harsh on Woody with the resulting glare (diffusing the light would help).  The "model" in back could use more lighting period.  If you wanted to minimize the "model" it may have worked better to minimize using a shallower DOF and blur him out some - but get some light back there.  :)  All of this is JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is unique and creative.  I think the lighting in two places is going to pull this down some.  The light is a little harsh on Woody with the resulting glare (diffusing the light would help).  The "model" in back could use more lighting period.  If you wanted to minimize the "model" it may have worked better to minimize using a shallower DOF and blur him out some - but get some light back there.  :)  All of this is JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-12 15:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2922771, 409812, 65779, '<td valign="top">Haha - good one.</td>', 'Haha - good one.', '2006-10-12 15:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
