(2922810, 409477, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the choice of tones here really makes the image kind of flat and bland looking.  It''s one of the cooler looking "Woody''s" in the challenge because of the uniqueness, but you haven''t brought that out in this photo.  This shot reminds me of a photo that should be used in a book that documents the history of "Woody''s".  Very static.  Nothing that gives this any artistic flavor.  Just giving my opinion...that''s all.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Sorry, but the choice of tones here really makes the image kind of flat and bland looking.  It''s one of the cooler looking "Woody''s" in the challenge because of the uniqueness, but you haven''t brought that out in this photo.  This shot reminds me of a photo that should be used in a book that documents the history of "Woody''s".  Very static.  Nothing that gives this any artistic flavor.  Just giving my opinion...that''s all.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-12 15:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
