(2923106, 408622, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m not catching the meaning of your title.  There''s a beautiful boat (well documented one too I might add &lt;grin&gt;) in the background already.  Yet Woody is sitting at an empty tie-down cleat.  Did you want us to enjoy the boat in the background (that''s the first object the eye is directed to)?  Woody seems like a secondary subject.  Another unfortunate item is the color of the tie-down cleat matches Woody and keeps Woody from standing out.  Sorry if I''m being a pain in the tail...just my opinion.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not catching the meaning of your title.  There''s a beautiful boat (well documented one too I might add <grin>) in the background already.  Yet Woody is sitting at an empty tie-down cleat.  Did you want us to enjoy the boat in the background (that''s the first object the eye is directed to)?  Woody seems like a secondary subject.  Another unfortunate item is the color of the tie-down cleat matches Woody and keeps Woody from standing out.  Sorry if I''m being a pain in the tail...just my opinion.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-12 16:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
