(2923315, 409820, 52449, '<td valign="top">Just curious, but what is the purpose of that red leaf? It''s a bit distracting. Was Woody''s foot mangled by a child or a dog? :-(</td>', 'Just curious, but what is the purpose of that red leaf? It''s a bit distracting. Was Woody''s foot mangled by a child or a dog? :-(', '2006-10-12 17:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
