(2923433, 409814, 63588, '<td valign="top">My eyes are drawn to the duck and it bothers me that it is out of focus. Nice story idea and the lighting sets the mood.</td>', 'My eyes are drawn to the duck and it bothers me that it is out of focus. Nice story idea and the lighting sets the mood.', '2006-10-12 18:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923435, 409702, 63588, '<td valign="top">I like the silhoutte (with just enough foreground detail) but I''m not sure if the screen is suppose to have any meaning.</td>', 'I like the silhoutte (with just enough foreground detail) but I''m not sure if the screen is suppose to have any meaning.', '2006-10-12 18:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923449, 409570, 63588, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the composition.</td>', 'I like the perspective and the composition.', '2006-10-12 18:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923454, 408782, 63588, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. Nice use of DOF and I like your composition. Posing of Woody fits with your title.</td>', 'Made me smile. Nice use of DOF and I like your composition. Posing of Woody fits with your title.', '2006-10-12 18:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923574, 409283, 46832, '<td valign="top">It helps to read the details in the challenge instructions ... 2</td>', 'It helps to read the details in the challenge instructions ... 2', '2006-10-12 19:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923579, 409282, 46832, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I didn''t know there were that many Woodies in existence.</td>', 'Wow!  I didn''t know there were that many Woodies in existence.', '2006-10-12 20:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923582, 409237, 46832, '<td valign="top">Ahh, these Woody-come-latelies.  They expect the same treatment without having to put in all the years of hard work.</td>', 'Ahh, these Woody-come-latelies.  They expect the same treatment without having to put in all the years of hard work.', '2006-10-12 20:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923585, 409397, 46832, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... maple woodie, pine tree.  Probably not Mom.</td>', 'Hmmm... maple woodie, pine tree.  Probably not Mom.', '2006-10-12 20:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923654, 406761, 52130, '<td valign="top">that''s histerical, love it. 10</td>', 'that''s histerical, love it. 10', '2006-10-12 20:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923658, 406761, 46832, '<td valign="top">Hilarious...</td>', 'Hilarious...', '2006-10-12 20:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923662, 409562, 46832, '<td valign="top">Good but a little too dark to really show off the hair.</td>', 'Good but a little too dark to really show off the hair.', '2006-10-12 20:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923668, 409657, 19436, '<td valign="top">WOW, this is really nice. Great exposure and lighting. Great Work.</td>', 'WOW, this is really nice. Great exposure and lighting. Great Work.', '2006-10-12 20:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923763, 408865, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but a tad dark for me.  Also the pose doesn''t hold me.  When I think of this line, there is a classic pose that comes to mind.  This one isn''t it.  But nice overall.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but a tad dark for me.  Also the pose doesn''t hold me.  When I think of this line, there is a classic pose that comes to mind.  This one isn''t it.  But nice overall.', '2006-10-12 21:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923769, 409729, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice fun idea, I just really do not care for the yellow cast over everything.  So might want to check your white balance, unless this is the effect you wanted.  Also I would have liked a differnce of background for them. make it look more studio-like.  Great Idea and comp.</td>', 'Nice fun idea, I just really do not care for the yellow cast over everything.  So might want to check your white balance, unless this is the effect you wanted.  Also I would have liked a differnce of background for them. make it look more studio-like.  Great Idea and comp.', '2006-10-12 21:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923775, 409812, 16197, '<td valign="top">sorry pal.  This just doesn''t cut the mustard and isn''t even cute.   Now, if you had a button fly and the head of a ''woodie'' they ment that would have been classy, but this, is just immature.</td>', 'sorry pal.  This just doesn''t cut the mustard and isn''t even cute.   Now, if you had a button fly and the head of a ''woodie'' they ment that would have been classy, but this, is just immature.', '2006-10-12 21:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923776, 409237, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice to be funny. nice light except for the background.. that drawls my eye.  But, concidering the challenge had a link to what a woodie is.  Have to say to bad so sad for this.</td>', 'Nice to be funny. nice light except for the background.. that drawls my eye.  But, concidering the challenge had a link to what a woodie is.  Have to say to bad so sad for this.', '2006-10-12 21:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923780, 407522, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  I really have to strain my eyes to view the one in the arms.  Maybe a small piece of cloth to swaddle to help stand apart.  Lighting is decent, but the bright spots appear oof.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  I really have to strain my eyes to view the one in the arms.  Maybe a small piece of cloth to swaddle to help stand apart.  Lighting is decent, but the bright spots appear oof.', '2006-10-12 21:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923789, 409020, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea.  At first look both figures look like plastic dolls.  Just something about it doesn''t tell me woodie.  Also, the lighting /reflections and such really bother me. seems to many seperate ones.  dof may need a touch differnce as well.</td>', 'Very interesting idea.  At first look both figures look like plastic dolls.  Just something about it doesn''t tell me woodie.  Also, the lighting /reflections and such really bother me. seems to many seperate ones.  dof may need a touch differnce as well.', '2006-10-12 21:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923796, 409397, 16197, '<td valign="top">outline frame cuts the image.  Normaly frames don''t bother me to much, but this one does.  The image itself has many great elements.  colour, dof, lighting... but I don''t care for the woodie to be hugging the tree.  If it was a question I believe it would be a differnt type of pose.  But very nice overall.</td>', 'outline frame cuts the image.  Normaly frames don''t bother me to much, but this one does.  The image itself has many great elements.  colour, dof, lighting... but I don''t care for the woodie to be hugging the tree.  If it was a question I believe it would be a differnt type of pose.  But very nice overall.', '2006-10-12 21:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923800, 409657, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice image, good lighting,  Doesn''t give me much excitement in the way of exploration, but it appears well exacuted.</td>', 'Nice image, good lighting,  Doesn''t give me much excitement in the way of exploration, but it appears well exacuted.', '2006-10-12 21:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923805, 409811, 16197, '<td valign="top">Ok the mirror effect is nice to gain more woodies, but throws me that I see the back of the next one.  To me it is very distracting.  I am wondering if a more classic ''morning'' against the wall pose would work better?  ust an idea.  I think contrasts also might need a touch.</td>', 'Ok the mirror effect is nice to gain more woodies, but throws me that I see the back of the next one.  To me it is very distracting.  I am wondering if a more classic ''morning'' against the wall pose would work better?  ust an idea.  I think contrasts also might need a touch.', '2006-10-12 21:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923809, 407406, 61903, '<td valign="top">I love the concept. I think the woody would have been better placed in the lighter part of the photo as it is the lighter area which draws the eye in.</td>', 'I love the concept. I think the woody would have been better placed in the lighter part of the photo as it is the lighter area which draws the eye in.', '2006-10-12 21:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923812, 408782, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea.  I think some levels or curves adjustments a touch.  Help it pop a little bit more.  To me it appears slightly flat and doesn''t seperate enough even with the dof.  But nice overall.</td>', 'Very cute idea.  I think some levels or curves adjustments a touch.  Help it pop a little bit more.  To me it appears slightly flat and doesn''t seperate enough even with the dof.  But nice overall.', '2006-10-12 21:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923817, 409827, 16197, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the green or the dof.  But it is a great concept and very imaginative.  If the frame is the point of view, it doesn''t stand strong enough for me.</td>', 'Not sure I like the green or the dof.  But it is a great concept and very imaginative.  If the frame is the point of view, it doesn''t stand strong enough for me.', '2006-10-12 21:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923822, 409844, 16197, '<td valign="top">fun consept.  But my eye is taken straight to the rinkled courner of the box for some reason.  Even though the speration is there from colour, my focus is still that courner.</td>', 'fun consept.  But my eye is taken straight to the rinkled courner of the box for some reason.  Even though the speration is there from colour, my focus is still that courner.', '2006-10-12 21:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923829, 407677, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is nice idea.  Everything seems to work well, except for the sky.  The cloud pattern is a bummer.  Colours seem fairly nice, looks pretty close to maybe straight from the camera.  Nice idea.</td>', 'This is nice idea.  Everything seems to work well, except for the sky.  The cloud pattern is a bummer.  Colours seem fairly nice, looks pretty close to maybe straight from the camera.  Nice idea.', '2006-10-12 21:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923867, 407358, 16197, '<td valign="top">Sorry charlie, this doesn''t fly.  The challenge does show what type of ''woodie'' to phtograph.  Personal I don''t like either of the effects you have used for this image as well.</td>', 'Sorry charlie, this doesn''t fly.  The challenge does show what type of ''woodie'' to phtograph.  Personal I don''t like either of the effects you have used for this image as well.', '2006-10-12 21:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923882, 407472, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very fun, seems like it may have been murder to get them to balance.  Nice contrast, but not sure I care for the shadow.  But very well done overall.</td>', 'Very fun, seems like it may have been murder to get them to balance.  Nice contrast, but not sure I care for the shadow.  But very well done overall.', '2006-10-12 21:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2923897, 409177, 16197, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, but I don''t care for the solid black.  It does not give me a feeling of space or distance.  If there was a little more texture on the ground to add some depth to the image, it would be much better.  But as it is now, all of the proportions look off to me.</td>', 'Fun idea, but I don''t care for the solid black.  It does not give me a feeling of space or distance.  If there was a little more texture on the ground to add some depth to the image, it would be much better.  But as it is now, all of the proportions look off to me.', '2006-10-12 21:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
