(2932617, 409482, 38032, '<td valign="top">that''s great! Not feeling too talkative today but I like this.</td>', 'that''s great! Not feeling too talkative today but I like this.', '2006-10-16 08:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2932622, 409844, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice image, nice composition, desat works well.  Looks like the image on the box is trying to get out!</td>', 'Nice image, nice composition, desat works well.  Looks like the image on the box is trying to get out!', '2006-10-16 08:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2932625, 409095, 48545, '<td valign="top">great fun image.  Did you break the arm, I''m guessing it is just cloned out, I like how the shadow is altered as well.  Some strange outlines around the arm, that I can''t figure out.</td>', 'great fun image.  Did you break the arm, I''m guessing it is just cloned out, I like how the shadow is altered as well.  Some strange outlines around the arm, that I can''t figure out.', '2006-10-16 08:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2932630, 408456, 48545, '<td valign="top">nice idea, has a slightly amateurish feel to it.  Think it is due to the slightly soft focus.</td>', 'nice idea, has a slightly amateurish feel to it.  Think it is due to the slightly soft focus.', '2006-10-16 08:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933079, 409827, 64175, '<td valign="top">The creativity aspect using the 35mm film is excellent.  I wish the main woody figure was a bit more in focus (less fuzzy).  7.</td>', 'The creativity aspect using the 35mm film is excellent.  I wish the main woody figure was a bit more in focus (less fuzzy).  7.', '2006-10-16 11:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933086, 409812, 64175, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of humor, but not sure if this is just a bit too over-the-top as one truly has to guess what type of "woody" is under that sheet.</td>', 'Love the sense of humor, but not sure if this is just a bit too over-the-top as one truly has to guess what type of "woody" is under that sheet.', '2006-10-16 11:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933095, 409836, 64175, '<td valign="top">Nice photo perspective (composition).</td>', 'Nice photo perspective (composition).', '2006-10-16 11:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933099, 409084, 64175, '<td valign="top">What would have topped this one off is to make the title a bit longer:<br/>"Hey, Come Back!  I need that for the Ducky Challenge!".  9.</td>', 'What would have topped this one off is to make the title a bit longer:"Hey, Come Back!  I need that for the Ducky Challenge!".  9.', '2006-10-16 11:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933742, 407685, 43298, '<td valign="top">HAHAH funny :)</td>', 'HAHAH funny :)', '2006-10-16 14:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933751, 409020, 43298, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHAHHAHAHAHHA So funny!</td>', 'HAHAHAHAHHAHAHAHHA So funny!', '2006-10-16 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933775, 409751, 43298, '<td valign="top">HAH, great title :)</td>', 'HAH, great title :)', '2006-10-16 14:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933922, 408764, 58610, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, but given current world events I find it a bit unsavory.</td>', 'This is a great shot, but given current world events I find it a bit unsavory.', '2006-10-16 15:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933933, 408773, 58610, '<td valign="top">I think you''re in thw wrong challenge.</td>', 'I think you''re in thw wrong challenge.', '2006-10-16 15:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933937, 409812, 58610, '<td valign="top">Woody has big feet.</td>', 'Woody has big feet.', '2006-10-16 15:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933939, 409283, 58610, '<td valign="top">Whaty?</td>', 'Whaty?', '2006-10-16 15:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933951, 407311, 58610, '<td valign="top">I love the intensity of this.</td>', 'I love the intensity of this.', '2006-10-16 15:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933952, 407358, 58610, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but?...</td>', 'Interesting, but?...', '2006-10-16 15:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933958, 408173, 50695, '<td valign="top">And finally the last argument for the continued existence of humanity was brought up before the Robot Council: emotion. If humans were to die out, then emotion would die with it. "Nonsense," said the District Attornoid, and presented as evidence this photograph, irrefutable proof that emotion exists in a world of pure symbols, pure iconography. There is nothing so emotional as the woodie who lusts for emotion within himself. Unable to fashion any retort, the humans'' Defenderbot rests his case. 10</td>', 'And finally the last argument for the continued existence of humanity was brought up before the Robot Council: emotion. If humans were to die out, then emotion would die with it. "Nonsense," said the District Attornoid, and presented as evidence this photograph, irrefutable proof that emotion exists in a world of pure symbols, pure iconography. There is nothing so emotional as the woodie who lusts for emotion within himself. Unable to fashion any retort, the humans'' Defenderbot rests his case. 10', '2006-10-16 15:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933960, 409661, 58610, '<td valign="top">Good emotional content and composition. Maybe you could have brought the highlights down just a bit.</td>', 'Good emotional content and composition. Maybe you could have brought the highlights down just a bit.', '2006-10-16 15:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933964, 409657, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, composition and focus.</td>', 'Nice lighting, composition and focus.', '2006-10-16 15:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933969, 409095, 50695, '<td valign="top">You have perfectly recreated the spirit not of reality but of an insane Kung Fu movie direct from Hong Kong, which is much more interesting. 10</td>', 'You have perfectly recreated the spirit not of reality but of an insane Kung Fu movie direct from Hong Kong, which is much more interesting. 10', '2006-10-16 15:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933973, 409266, 58610, '<td valign="top">But, does he have to DIE for that mistake? Please, think of the children.</td>', 'But, does he have to DIE for that mistake? Please, think of the children.', '2006-10-16 15:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933974, 409755, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is the saddest picture ever, and it''s of a woodie. What''s wrong with you?? 10</td>', 'This is the saddest picture ever, and it''s of a woodie. What''s wrong with you?? 10', '2006-10-16 15:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933980, 406453, 50695, '<td valign="top">10 for sheer cojones, and actually it''s a good picture, too. It would make a good ikon.</td>', '10 for sheer cojones, and actually it''s a good picture, too. It would make a good ikon.', '2006-10-16 15:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933982, 409719, 58610, '<td valign="top">Shoulda put HER in front. You''d score better. :)</td>', 'Shoulda put HER in front. You''d score better. :)', '2006-10-16 15:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933986, 409812, 50695, '<td valign="top">10 for the laugh and the creepy Depth Of Feet.</td>', '10 for the laugh and the creepy Depth Of Feet.', '2006-10-16 15:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933988, 409477, 50695, '<td valign="top">my what a beautiful woody you have! 9</td>', 'my what a beautiful woody you have! 9', '2006-10-16 15:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2933994, 408823, 50695, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the Little Prince movie, for some reason. I guess it''s the 70''s era child-fantasy feeling. You evoke it very well. I (almost) always like being put it into another world. 9</td>', 'This reminds me of the Little Prince movie, for some reason. I guess it''s the 70''s era child-fantasy feeling. You evoke it very well. I (almost) always like being put it into another world. 9', '2006-10-16 15:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934002, 406761, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is so funny that I wanted to give it a 9, but I just can''t. I have to give it a 10.</td>', 'This is so funny that I wanted to give it a 9, but I just can''t. I have to give it a 10.', '2006-10-16 15:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934010, 409827, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, like the banner of a film company (that does all-woody films). Very expressive model. 8</td>', 'Nicely done, like the banner of a film company (that does all-woody films). Very expressive model. 8', '2006-10-16 15:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934017, 408764, 50695, '<td valign="top">This gives me an ouchy feeling. 8</td>', 'This gives me an ouchy feeling. 8', '2006-10-16 15:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934024, 409661, 50695, '<td valign="top">You make me believe the woody really is sad, regardless of what he is really feeling (probably bored). 8</td>', 'You make me believe the woody really is sad, regardless of what he is really feeling (probably bored). 8', '2006-10-16 15:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934028, 407685, 50695, '<td valign="top">creative fulfillment of the challenge and well executed to seem like a nature shot or part of a nature documentary. oh yeah, and it''s FUNNY. 9</td>', 'creative fulfillment of the challenge and well executed to seem like a nature shot or part of a nature documentary. oh yeah, and it''s FUNNY. 9', '2006-10-16 15:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934033, 409833, 50695, '<td valign="top">Well executed to make woody look like he''s drawn on the page. 9</td>', 'Well executed to make woody look like he''s drawn on the page. 9', '2006-10-16 15:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934037, 409811, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is probably the most poignant photo in a very nonpoignant challenge. 9</td>', 'This is probably the most poignant photo in a very nonpoignant challenge. 9', '2006-10-16 15:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934041, 409266, 50695, '<td valign="top">well done! I fear for him. 8</td>', 'well done! I fear for him. 8', '2006-10-16 15:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934044, 407271, 50695, '<td valign="top">great angle! shooting a rattler from a horse, is so archetypally texan. well done. 8</td>', 'great angle! shooting a rattler from a horse, is so archetypally texan. well done. 8', '2006-10-16 15:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934180, 408254, 58610, '<td valign="top">A polerizing filter would reduce the glare.</td>', 'A polerizing filter would reduce the glare.', '2006-10-16 16:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934184, 408462, 58610, '<td valign="top">I like the echo of the bottle shape in woody''s body language.</td>', 'I like the echo of the bottle shape in woody''s body language.', '2006-10-16 16:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934188, 407522, 58610, '<td valign="top">Just a shave off the old block.</td>', 'Just a shave off the old block.', '2006-10-16 16:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2934192, 409761, 58610, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a greater dof in this shot. Maybe Woody could be singled out with lighting instead.</td>', 'I''d like to see a greater dof in this shot. Maybe Woody could be singled out with lighting instead.', '2006-10-16 16:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
