(2934224, 408782, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range.Good lighting. Nothing is too dark or light. I like the dof. Good composition.I guess the only thing missing is something to catch my eye. That isn''t to say that there isn''t interest in this photo - there is. I think a different background might have helped - something to add visual contrast.</td>', 'Nice tonal range.Good lighting. Nothing is too dark or light. I like the dof. Good composition.I guess the only thing missing is something to catch my eye. That isn''t to say that there isn''t interest in this photo - there is. I think a different background might have helped - something to add visual contrast.', '2006-10-16 17:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
