(2936609, 408173, 58610, '<td valign="top">You did it. You made me feel sorry for Woody. I can identify with the poor guy. Great setting and dof. Love that only the image in the mirror is in focus.</td>', 'You did it. You made me feel sorry for Woody. I can identify with the poor guy. Great setting and dof. Love that only the image in the mirror is in focus.', '2006-10-17 14:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
