(2936630, 409751, 58610, '<td valign="top">Perhaps he could impress her with his polished personality. Well, he is a little dull, though, isn''t he?<br/>Good lighting. I find myself wanting for a little more depth, though the shallowness of the picture reflects the text.</td>', 'Perhaps he could impress her with his polished personality. Well, he is a little dull, though, isn''t he?Good lighting. I find myself wanting for a little more depth, though the shallowness of the picture reflects the text.', '2006-10-17 14:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
