(2938948, 406453, 28742, '<td valign="top">As a Christian in an often-hostile-to-Christian community, I was not sure if this was poking fun or if it was meant as a legitimate symbol of your faith. Glad to know it was the latter. Either way, I gave it a 7 for it''s photographic quality mainly.<br/> <br/>I''m still not wholly comfortable with the image since it''s hard for me to separate Woody from humor, but I am adding to my fav''s just as a reminder to be bold in my faith as you have been.</td>', 'As a Christian in an often-hostile-to-Christian community, I was not sure if this was poking fun or if it was meant as a legitimate symbol of your faith. Glad to know it was the latter. Either way, I gave it a 7 for it''s photographic quality mainly. I''m still not wholly comfortable with the image since it''s hard for me to separate Woody from humor, but I am adding to my fav''s just as a reminder to be bold in my faith as you have been.', '2006-10-18 02:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2938966, 409661, 28742, '<td valign="top">A little fuzzy in some areas and hot spots, but overall a good job.<br/> <br/>...and I think he is sad because you broke his kneecaps! ;-P</td>', 'A little fuzzy in some areas and hot spots, but overall a good job. ...and I think he is sad because you broke his kneecaps! ;-P', '2006-10-18 02:13:44.000000', NULL, 0),
