(2939468, 406453, 55838, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by landcamera:</b></div><hr/><i> I was surprised this one didn''t do better; I was expecting at least a top 10 finish if not a ribbon.  Fantastic idea, your representation of the sacrifice Christ made was summed up perfectly in your title, as was the use of a red background symbolizing the blood of Christ.  Thanks for sharing your faith. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I must say I completely agree with landcamera.  I felt the tone of the shot and the title made it very clear that this was not a sick joke.  I am utterly flabbergasted at the 26 votes of 3 and under!  I''m afraid many voters (as usual) were unable to separate their feelings on the subject from rating the merits of the pic.  For shame!  This should have finished WAAAAAAAAY higher.<br/> <br/>Oh yeah.....and your SEXY!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-18 05:52:59.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by landcamera: I was surprised this one didn''t do better; I was expecting at least a top 10 finish if not a ribbon.  Fantastic idea, your representation of the sacrifice Christ made was summed up perfectly in your title, as was the use of a red background symbolizing the blood of Christ.  Thanks for sharing your faith.   I must say I completely agree with landcamera.  I felt the tone of the shot and the title made it very clear that this was not a sick joke.  I am utterly flabbergasted at the 26 votes of 3 and under!  I''m afraid many voters (as usual) were unable to separate their feelings on the subject from rating the merits of the pic.  For shame!  This should have finished WAAAAAAAAY higher. Oh yeah.....and your SEXY!', '2006-10-18 06:49:20.000000', '2006-10-18 06:52:59.000000', 0),
