(2939525, 406453, 34938, '<td valign="top"><i>Post Challenge - Wow - 26 votes under 3 and I still pull off a 6.</i> <br/> <br/>I guess it was going to inspire or alienate people Tim, I can see what you were trying to do, but perhaps, who knows, perhaps some people thought you were poking fun. Because I know your character and beliefs I understand it, but during voting we don''t know who is who and so it could have been someone being blasphemous...we spoke about that through our PM''s. <br/> <br/>Thanks for declaring your faith OUT LOUD in your explanation<br/>1 Corinthians 15:58</td>', 'Post Challenge - Wow - 26 votes under 3 and I still pull off a 6.  I guess it was going to inspire or alienate people Tim, I can see what you were trying to do, but perhaps, who knows, perhaps some people thought you were poking fun. Because I know your character and beliefs I understand it, but during voting we don''t know who is who and so it could have been someone being blasphemous...we spoke about that through our PM''s.  Thanks for declaring your faith OUT LOUD in your explanation1 Corinthians 15:58', '2006-10-18 07:42:37.000000', NULL, 0),
