(2939873, 406453, 24454, '<td valign="top">I don''t think there is even a trace of "poking fun" conveyed in this photo!  It''s beautifully done, and it always touches me and means so much when people speak their faith in their photography, or in everything they do for that matter!<br/> <br/>I''ve been so busy, I didn''t get a chance to vote on this challenge, but if I had, you definitely would have had 17 10''s!   <br/> <br/>And the main thing:  I think your Savior is pleased and proud of you and your tribute to Him!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I don''t think there is even a trace of "poking fun" conveyed in this photo!  It''s beautifully done, and it always touches me and means so much when people speak their faith in their photography, or in everything they do for that matter! I''ve been so busy, I didn''t get a chance to vote on this challenge, but if I had, you definitely would have had 17 10''s!    And the main thing:  I think your Savior is pleased and proud of you and your tribute to Him!!!! ', '2006-10-18 10:11:10.000000', NULL, 0),
