(2940418, 409812, 64175, '<td valign="top">Everyone (well, okay, most everyone) was thinking it at one point or another, and you were the only one with enough ca-ho-nes to do it. &lt;clap,clap&gt;<br/> Extra points for humor, but ultimately a DNMC which can''t score above a 3 in my scale.<br/> <br/>I agree with the post that there are some really uptight people on here. It wasn''t like the thing was exposed.  It made you think, even just a little.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-18 12:03:28.</i></td>', 'Everyone (well, okay, most everyone) was thinking it at one point or another, and you were the only one with enough ca-ho-nes to do it. <clap,clap> Extra points for humor, but ultimately a DNMC which can''t score above a 3 in my scale. I agree with the post that there are some really uptight people on here. It wasn''t like the thing was exposed.  It made you think, even just a little.', '2006-10-18 13:02:39.000000', '2006-10-18 13:03:28.000000', 0);
