(2940790, 409572, 50695, '<td valign="top">I feel I''ve neglected your woody. I only gave it a 6 and didn''t comment on it. This is an example of how spending more time with each picture would help me appreciate more. Nice use of chiaroscuro, which evokes the movie that is the source for your quote. I suppose I wanted you to recreate the whole scene...</td>', 'I feel I''ve neglected your woody. I only gave it a 6 and didn''t comment on it. This is an example of how spending more time with each picture would help me appreciate more. Nice use of chiaroscuro, which evokes the movie that is the source for your quote. I suppose I wanted you to recreate the whole scene...', '2006-10-18 14:59:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2940800, 409591, 3569, '<td valign="top">Hey Richard,<br/> <br/>I had a feeling this shot would get shot down by not meeting the subject and lack of sense of humour on this site sometimes.  It one of my highest votes.  I like out-of-the-box shots.  Van</td>', 'Hey Richard, I had a feeling this shot would get shot down by not meeting the subject and lack of sense of humour on this site sometimes.  It one of my highest votes.  I like out-of-the-box shots.  Van', '2006-10-18 15:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2940825, 409811, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very nice job! Congrats on personal best! One thing that surprised me about this image when I saw it; if it were mine I''d have had woody facing AWAY from the camera, so the first instance of his face would be the primary reflection. This would have been more poignant to me, as it would give him something to "be saluting"...</td>', 'Very nice job! Congrats on personal best! One thing that surprised me about this image when I saw it; if it were mine I''d have had woody facing AWAY from the camera, so the first instance of his face would be the primary reflection. This would have been more poignant to me, as it would give him something to "be saluting"...', '2006-10-18 15:09:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2940839, 406761, 38032, '<td valign="top">Love it ... very original (LOL) - What a great idea to pay homage to Goodman.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jfwolpert:</b></div><hr/><i> now this is ribbon material.  way to go girl!  it was one of my fav''s as it is very original. and in the 7''s we are on the rise! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Love it ... very original (LOL) - What a great idea to pay homage to Goodman. Originally posted by jfwolpert: now this is ribbon material.  way to go girl!  it was one of my fav''s as it is very original. and in the 7''s we are on the rise! ', '2006-10-18 15:16:03.000000', NULL, 0),
