(2941355, 407901, 25355, '<td valign="top">This is a really good job with the posing of Woody, and it''s an amazing balancing job - unless you cloned out his stand. Spectacular scenery, too, of course.<br/>  Plus, your username made me laugh. ;&gt;þ</td>', 'This is a really good job with the posing of Woody, and it''s an amazing balancing job - unless you cloned out his stand. Spectacular scenery, too, of course.  Plus, your username made me laugh. ;>þ', '2006-10-18 18:06:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2941483, 408617, 65763, '<td valign="top">I find it amazing that a wooden figure can convey such deep human emotion.  I love this picture.  Good work.</td>', 'I find it amazing that a wooden figure can convey such deep human emotion.  I love this picture.  Good work.', '2006-10-18 18:45:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2941562, 406884, 66515, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your reply. I really appreciate the honest feedback that I received for this entry. In retrospect, I should have submitted my Ducky picture but this entry helped me learn so much about this community. Other sites pretty much just say "Nice" and "Good shot" etc without any detailed comments. I also appreciate that the ratings are hard to come by. (I.e. If you get a 10 it is quite significant). <br/> <br/>Thanks again to all who took the time to vote and comment.<br/> <br/>C</td>', 'Thank you all for your reply. I really appreciate the honest feedback that I received for this entry. In retrospect, I should have submitted my Ducky picture but this entry helped me learn so much about this community. Other sites pretty much just say "Nice" and "Good shot" etc without any detailed comments. I also appreciate that the ratings are hard to come by. (I.e. If you get a 10 it is quite significant).  Thanks again to all who took the time to vote and comment. C', '2006-10-18 19:16:08.000000', NULL, 0),
