(2942947, 408617, 32872, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your Blue. It''s amazing how you conveyed a human, heartfelt expression by using a wooden human figure.<br/> <br/>Out of grief comes art. (sorry to hear about your loss)<br/></td>', 'Congratulations on your Blue. It''s amazing how you conveyed a human, heartfelt expression by using a wooden human figure. Out of grief comes art. (sorry to hear about your loss)', '2006-10-19 03:08:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2943208, 407685, 25355, '<td valign="top">I think you had a very clever idea that went over most people''s heads. This may have been because you yourself went overboard with it. Instead of presenting him in his "natural" environment, you could have used him in a studio set-up as if he were a "normal" Woody. (And with more bend in the knees ;&gt;þ)</td>', 'I think you had a very clever idea that went over most people''s heads. This may have been because you yourself went overboard with it. Instead of presenting him in his "natural" environment, you could have used him in a studio set-up as if he were a "normal" Woody. (And with more bend in the knees ;>þ)', '2006-10-19 07:10:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2943242, 406150, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow - after reading through the comments I have to wonder if we''re all looking at the same photograph.  I see nothing at all wrong with the "focus" and am pretty sure I don''t want it deeper or shallower or closer to the viewer (and I am usually one who is disconcerted by OOF foregrounds.)  In other words, I thought this was a darn fine take on the challenge.  I also think it would make a great cover for a book.</td>', 'Wow - after reading through the comments I have to wonder if we''re all looking at the same photograph.  I see nothing at all wrong with the "focus" and am pretty sure I don''t want it deeper or shallower or closer to the viewer (and I am usually one who is disconcerted by OOF foregrounds.)  In other words, I thought this was a darn fine take on the challenge.  I also think it would make a great cover for a book.', '2006-10-19 07:48:59.000000', NULL, 0),
