(2943655, 409482, 48389, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea Jude! Well done on your score and another shot in your top 5! I like the comedy element to this shot! The choice of background and the nice lighting really help this image too IMHO</td>', 'Excellent idea Jude! Well done on your score and another shot in your top 5! I like the comedy element to this shot! The choice of background and the nice lighting really help this image too IMHO', '2006-10-19 11:59:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2943669, 409442, 66201, '<td valign="top">A lot of people got worked up about Woody on his stand... I don''t know why I didn''t root it out of him: he just seems to be connected to it/ as if it''s a part of him and it didn''t bother me at the time..anyway: no reasons really.<br/> <br/>As for the black dot being distracting: okay I had a quick look at him again, and realised too late that I (as a few others had) had twisted the poor little guy''s head around and in fact he DOES have a face. The dot should be at the back of his head. Ooops. <br/> <br/>Thanks for all the supportive and constructive comments. This site is fast becoming addicitve!</td>', 'A lot of people got worked up about Woody on his stand... I don''t know why I didn''t root it out of him: he just seems to be connected to it/ as if it''s a part of him and it didn''t bother me at the time..anyway: no reasons really. As for the black dot being distracting: okay I had a quick look at him again, and realised too late that I (as a few others had) had twisted the poor little guy''s head around and in fact he DOES have a face. The dot should be at the back of his head. Ooops.  Thanks for all the supportive and constructive comments. This site is fast becoming addicitve!', '2006-10-19 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
