(2947750, 407685, 57620, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pug-H:</b></div><hr/><i> I think you had a very clever idea that went over most people''s heads. This may have been because you yourself went overboard with it. Instead of presenting him in his "natural" environment, you could have used him in a studio set-up as if he were a "normal" Woody. (And with more bend in the knees ;&gt;þ) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I can see how that ''wood'' have helped thanks for the feedback.</td>', 'Originally posted by Pug-H: I think you had a very clever idea that went over most people''s heads. This may have been because you yourself went overboard with it. Instead of presenting him in his "natural" environment, you could have used him in a studio set-up as if he were a "normal" Woody. (And with more bend in the knees ;>þ)   I can see how that ''wood'' have helped thanks for the feedback.', '2006-10-20 19:11:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2947988, 409253, 21026, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by faery:</b></div><hr/><i> Intriguing shot. It just doesn''t tell a story about Woody...but then I suppose he is being used in a very sci-fi mode here and that''s okay. Almost ahs the look of doing those ribbon gymnastic sequences about it. I like the movement of the swirling light around the static figure. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sure it tells a story,  Woody is doing a new Ipod Nano Commercial.  I loved it.  What did you do to make the nano swirls?  EDIT:  Need to read  LOL  Nice photo...  Saw the how you did it in the explanation.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-20 19:57:45.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by faery: Intriguing shot. It just doesn''t tell a story about Woody...but then I suppose he is being used in a very sci-fi mode here and that''s okay. Almost ahs the look of doing those ribbon gymnastic sequences about it. I like the movement of the swirling light around the static figure.   Sure it tells a story,  Woody is doing a new Ipod Nano Commercial.  I loved it.  What did you do to make the nano swirls?  EDIT:  Need to read  LOL  Nice photo...  Saw the how you did it in the explanation.', '2006-10-20 20:56:47.000000', '2006-10-20 20:57:45.000000', 0),
